>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MONSTER-BOOTSTRAP.

DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BASE-CONTEXT.
   05 CTX-CALCULATION-DAY.
      10 CTX-C-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
      10 CTX-C-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
      10 CTX-C-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
      10 CTX-C-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
   05 CTX-TARGET-DAY.
      10 CTX-T-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
      10 CTX-T-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
      10 CTX-T-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
      10 CTX-T-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
   05 CTX-PHASE PIC X(24) VALUE SPACES.
   05 CTX-SUBPHASE PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 CTX-MODE PIC X(24) VALUE "BOOTSTRAP".
   05 CTX-STATUS PIC X(24) VALUE "NEW".
   05 CTX-CURRENT-HANDLER PIC X(32) VALUE SPACES.
   05 CTX-PREVIOUS-HANDLER PIC X(32) VALUE SPACES.
   05 CTX-VALIDATION-FAILURES PIC 9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 CTX-METRIC-DISPATCHES PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 CTX-METRIC-VALIDATIONS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 CTX-LAST-ERROR PIC X(160) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-ACTION PIC X(16).
01 LK-CALCULATION-DAY.
   05 LK-C-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LK-C-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LK-C-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LK-C-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-TARGET-DAY.
   05 LK-T-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LK-T-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LK-T-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LK-T-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-MESSAGE PIC X(160).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-ACTION LK-CALCULATION-DAY LK-TARGET-DAY LK-STATUS LK-MESSAGE.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS WS-STATUS
    MOVE SPACES TO LK-MESSAGE CTX-LAST-ERROR

    MOVE LK-C-SIGN TO CTX-C-SIGN
    MOVE LK-C-CHUNKS TO CTX-C-CHUNKS
    SET CTX-C-HEAD TO LK-C-HEAD
    SET CTX-C-TAIL TO LK-C-TAIL
    MOVE LK-T-SIGN TO CTX-T-SIGN
    MOVE LK-T-CHUNKS TO CTX-T-CHUNKS
    SET CTX-T-HEAD TO LK-T-HEAD
    SET CTX-T-TAIL TO LK-T-TAIL

    MOVE "ENTRY" TO CTX-PHASE
    MOVE "BaseDispatcher" TO CTX-CURRENT-HANDLER
    ADD 1 TO CTX-METRIC-DISPATCHES

    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-ACTION)
        WHEN "PING"
            PERFORM VALIDATE-BASE-CONTEXT
            IF WS-STATUS = 0
                MOVE "READY" TO CTX-STATUS
                MOVE "基础调度器、验证器、错误包装器和指标外壳已就绪。" TO LK-MESSAGE
            END-IF
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 20 TO WS-STATUS
            MOVE "基础调度器收到未知操作。" TO CTX-LAST-ERROR
    END-EVALUATE

    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0
        MOVE "FAILED" TO CTX-STATUS
        MOVE CTX-LAST-ERROR TO LK-MESSAGE
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS
    GOBACK.

VALIDATE-BASE-CONTEXT.
    MOVE "BaseValidator" TO CTX-PREVIOUS-HANDLER
    ADD 1 TO CTX-METRIC-VALIDATIONS
    IF CTX-MODE NOT = "BOOTSTRAP"
        ADD 1 TO CTX-VALIDATION-FAILURES
        MOVE 21 TO WS-STATUS
        MOVE "基础上下文模式不符合引导阶段不变量。" TO CTX-LAST-ERROR
    END-IF
    IF CTX-C-SIGN < -1 OR CTX-C-SIGN > 1 OR CTX-T-SIGN < -1 OR CTX-T-SIGN > 1
        ADD 1 TO CTX-VALIDATION-FAILURES
        MOVE 22 TO WS-STATUS
        MOVE "基础上下文中的任意精度整数符号无效。" TO CTX-LAST-ERROR
    END-IF.
END PROGRAM MONSTER-BOOTSTRAP.
